      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ YouTube Video Comments Sentiment & Competitor Product Complaint Miner\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nAnalyze viewer comments on top YouTube reviews in your industry to extract feature requests and competitor pain points.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/youtube-comments-scraper`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/youtube-comments-scraper) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify YouTube Comments Scraper - Viewer Sentiment** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract live structured JSON records!",
